    "id": "layer:big-integer-arithmetic",
    "name": "Big Integer Arithmetic",
    "description": "Custom arbitrary-precision integer arithmetic library. Provides LargeInteger (schoolbook/FFT/NTT multiplication), MontgomeryInteger (Montgomery modular multiplication with Karatsuba), ECMBigInteger (totient, Moebius, Aurifeuillian factors), AprtCleInteger (APR-CL primality proving with Jacobi sums), FactorInteger (factorization result tracking), and StaticFunctions (31/32-bit digit conversion and modular helpers). Depends on utilities layer for FFT/NTT.",
