    "id": "layer:rpn-calculator",
    "name": "RPN Calculator",
    "description": "Reverse Polish Notation (RPN) integer calculator with Swing GUI (MVC architecture). The javamodel sub-package provides operations using standard Java integers; the largemodel sub-package reimplements the same operations using the custom LargeInteger class for arbitrary precision. Core interfaces: Calculator (model), CalculatorUI (view), and concrete implementations DefaultUI (Swing), with Operation and EncodedOperation abstractions. Includes Deque data structure, NumericDocument input filter, and ConvertBase. Depends on Big Integers layer (largemodel uses LargeInteger).",
